{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And his wrath burned against his three friends</b> — because they condemned Job. And so they said to him: \"Is not your evil great? Your own mouth condemns you, and not I.\" \"The way everlasting you maintain.\" And it is written כי הוא מתקון סופרים. And those who say thus know what is hidden from me."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "The phrase כי הוא מתקון סופרים is textually obscure; translated hyper-literally as 'for it is of the correction/restoration of scribes.' The scriptural citations embedded mid-sentence are fragmentary and their boundaries uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:15.092415787Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}